# Sprite / masked drawing, ported from r_things.c to Flow.
#
# Shared clip / scale globals, sprites[] / numsprites, and sprite init
# scratch (sprtemp) are Flow-owned via offsetof/calloc below. Column
# drawer fnptr switching (colfunc) lives in rmain.flow.
#
# vissprite_t is module-private: Flow VisSprite (LP64 sizeof 80, matches
# C) allocated as a heap pool so sort-list pointers stay stable.
# overflow / sorted-head sentinels are module statics.
#
# mobj_t via MOBJ_*; sector_t via GEOM_*; drawseg_t via BSP_*;
# patch_t via PATCH_* / RDATA_PATCH_*; lighting / viewplayer via RMAIN_*;
# pspdef_t via PSP_*.

